            "text": "{{Use dmy dates|cs1-dates=ly|date=June 2020}}"
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Blechnum occidentale is a fern in the family Blechnaceae. Its native range is from Mexico through Central America and the Caribbean to tropical South America."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p3",
            "text": "Blechnum scaberulum and Blechnum sodiroi have been regarded as separate species, but are now regarded as synonyms of Blechnum occidentale."
          }
        ]
